{"vid":"S8tzsU2zHH4","source":"S8tzsU2zHH4.en-GB.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":3.4,"txt":"Have you ever felt like you can't show your true personality in English?"},{"t":8.9,"txt":"Maybe in your first language you're confident, sociable, passionate."},{"t":13.9,"txt":"But when you have to speak in English,"},{"t":16,"txt":"you feel you can't show people who you truly are."},{"t":19.8,"txt":"Why can it be so hard to be yourself in a foreign language?"},{"t":25.1,"txt":"Well, to truly be yourself, you usually need to feel comfortable."},{"t":29.8,"txt":"And that's true of any situation, right?"},{"t":32.7,"txt":"If you're not comfortable walking into a room full of strangers at an event,"},{"t":36.9,"txt":"for example, you might not feel able to be yourself."},{"t":40.8,"txt":"And that's the same with speaking a foreign language."},{"t":43.4,"txt":"If you feel uncomfortable doing it,"},{"t":45.6,"txt":"it's going to be harder to show your personality."},{"t":49,"txt":"It's like you want to tell everyone that - I'm cool,"},{"t":52.2,"txt":"I'm, I'm actually cool person, right?"},{"t":54.8,"txt":"It's not like, you know, I presented, the way I presented in"},{"t":59.4,"txt":"in the second language."},{"t":61.7,"txt":"You also have fewer language tools available. In your first language,"},{"t":66.3,"txt":"you know how to play with words, how to play with intonation."},{"t":70.2,"txt":"Your brain just isn't having to work too hard."},{"t":73.2,"txt":"But in a foreign language, these things are less automatic."},{"t":78.2,"txt":"So how can we get better at showing our personality in English?"},{"t":84.4,"txt":"One way is to practise talking about something"},{"t":87.3,"txt":"that you're passionate about."},{"t":89.3,"txt":"The learners here at our speaking confidence workshop"},{"t":92.7,"txt":"are doing exactly that."},{"t":95.6,"txt":"The idea is that you'll naturally feel excited about speaking,"},{"t":99.3,"txt":"and the people listening will feel your passion and interest in the topic,"},{"t":104,"txt":"even if you don't have all the words to describe it."},{"t":107.7,"txt":"Let's listen to this learner, whose passion is learning languages."},{"t":112.7,"txt":"Why are you so passionate about learning languages?"},{"t":116,"txt":"Um, because it opens you - a world."},{"t":119.7,"txt":"You can see how people think different, but also same."},{"t":125.4,"txt":"So it's quite interesting to see that humans are sometimes different,"},{"t":131.7,"txt":"but they can share the same thoughts."},{"t":134.8,"txt":"Um, so it's, it's quite interesting."},{"t":136.7,"txt":"And also, uh, it's related to the culture."},{"t":139.1,"txt":"So to see differences, but also, uh, things in common."},{"t":143.1,"txt":"It's interesting."},{"t":145,"txt":"Why not try this yourself?"},{"t":147,"txt":"Talk to someone about your passions, or if you're on your own,"},{"t":150.7,"txt":"talk to yourself in the mirror or record yourself talking about it."},{"t":154.9,"txt":"It may feel silly, but it can really help."},{"t":158.8,"txt":"Go further with your interests."},{"t":160.8,"txt":"Join a community."},{"t":162.3,"txt":"Start a hobby, or join a discussion group about something"},{"t":165.9,"txt":"you're interested in, in English."},{"t":168.7,"txt":"You'll meet like-minded people who share your passions,"},{"t":172.2,"txt":"and you'll be able to learn relevant language at the same time."},{"t":178,"txt":"You could even learn from a role model."},{"t":180.3,"txt":"So think about someone who communicates well in English as a foreign language."},{"t":185.6,"txt":"It could be someone you know or maybe someone famous."},{"t":188.6,"txt":"How are they showing their personality, and what can you learn from them?"},{"t":193.1,"txt":"Try the podcast episode about showing your personality"},{"t":196.5,"txt":"to hear more from learners and experts."},{"t":199.1,"txt":"I hope you've enjoyed these tips for beating speaking anxiety. Goodbye for now."}],"words":[{"t":3.4